+/* Slickrock: NDK r27 and later no longer declare ALooper_pollAll.
+ * The platform defines it as ALooper_pollOnce repeated while the
+ * result is ALOOPER_POLL_CALLBACK, with the timeout counted against
+ * one deadline (system/core libutils Looper::pollAll). This is that
